  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ様！\r\n浴衣、その柄にしたんだな。似合ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "お疲れ様ー、ありがと",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040070110",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……は、いいんだけど\r\nそっちはなんで浴衣じゃないわけー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "見慣れたスーツ姿なんですが",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、いやぁ……まだ少し仕事があってさ\r\nこのあともスタッフさんと会う予定があるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "まだちょっと早いかなと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "んもう\r\n見たかったのにー",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺としては命拾いした感じだな……\r\n結華の前で服選ぶのは緊張する",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "なんでよ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『えっ、その柄にその帯合わせちゃう？　あー……』\r\nみたいなことになったら耐えられないからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "しないよそんなファッションチェックみたいなこと！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close6",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っていうかそもそも、浴衣も帯も\r\n素敵なのをホテル側が選んでくれてるから！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "勝利が約束されてる選択肢の中から選ぶだけだからね？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでもその中での一番の不正解を叩き出さないか\r\n心配になる、そういう人間もいるんだよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──とまぁ、雑談はこれくらいにして\r\n打ち合わせ、いくか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はーい",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
