    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──じゃなくて本当にすまん！\r\n身支度ジロジロ見ながら感想言って！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "se": "0454"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……イエ\r\n席を外さなかった三峰にも非はあるので",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_jito",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_jito",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200701702/2007017020180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007017020190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "…………でも、褒め言葉だったら\r\nなんでも言っていいわけじゃないってことは",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close5",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
